WEBVTT
Language: pt-BR

1
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.215 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Neste vídeo,

2
00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:05.464 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
você conhece a interface do Simulador

3
00:00:05.474 --> 00:00:07.188 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e registra nele o seu sistema,

4
00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:09.437 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
como o Ganesha faz no ambiente oficial.

5
00:00:09.447 --> 00:00:11.612 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Primeiro, o que é o cadastro; depois,

6
00:00:11.622 --> 00:00:13.336 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a interface; por fim,

7
00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.470 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o cadastro feito por você no terminal.

8
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.394 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O HubSaúde só aceita pedidos

9
00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:21.500 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
de um sistema cadastrado. O cadastro

10
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.840 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
reúne a parte pública do certificado,

11
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.530 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o client_id e as permissões.

12
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.681 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No ambiente oficial,

13
00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:30.060 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o gestor da instituição solicita o acesso

14
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:33.490 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
no Ganesha e anexa somente o arquivo .cer.

15
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.900 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Aprovado o pedido pela

16
00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.468 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Secretaria de Estado da Saúde,

17
00:00:36.478 --> 00:00:38.559 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o Ganesha cadastra a chave pública,

18
00:00:38.569 --> 00:00:39.903 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com os acessos do serviço,

19
00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:42.130 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e devolve o client_id.

20
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.243 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No Simulador, você mesmo faz esse papel.

21
00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:47.474 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Primeiro, gera um certificado de teste,

22
00:00:47.484 --> 00:00:50.450 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com a chave privada e a parte pública.

23
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.242 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Depois,

24
00:00:51.252 --> 00:00:53.996 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
registra o sistema: envia a parte pública,

25
00:00:54.006 --> 00:00:55.450 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
escolhe o client_id,

26
00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.057 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que no curso é meu-sistema,

27
00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.100 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e informa as permissões.

28
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.897 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A chave privada nunca é enviada: fica

29
00:01:01.907 --> 00:01:04.468 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
no seu computador e, no módulo 4,

30
00:01:04.478 --> 00:01:07.180 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
comprova a identidade do sistema.

31
00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.845 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
As permissões são chamadas de escopos.

32
00:01:10.855 --> 00:01:13.170 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Cada escopo indica um tipo de registro

33
00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:15.780 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e as operações permitidas sobre ele.

34
00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.174 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Veja um exemplo de escopo:

35
00:01:18.184 --> 00:01:22.480 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
system/Patient.c. A primeira parte,

36
00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.907 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
system, indica que o acesso é feito por

37
00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.334 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
um sistema, sem uma pessoa conectada.

38
00:01:27.344 --> 00:01:29.683 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Patient é o registro de paciente,

39
00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:31.954 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e a letra c, depois do ponto,

40
00:01:31.964 --> 00:01:35.712 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
significa criar. Em Patient.rs,

41
00:01:35.722 --> 00:01:37.748 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a letra r significa ler,

42
00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:40.300 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e a letra s, pesquisar.

43
00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.478 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O curso usa três escopos.

44
00:01:42.488 --> 00:01:45.091 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com Patient.c, o seu sistema cria

45
00:01:45.101 --> 00:01:48.395 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
registros de paciente; com Patient.rs,

46
00:01:48.405 --> 00:01:50.830 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
lê e pesquisa esses registros.

47
00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:54.723 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com Task.rs, acompanha o envio:

48
00:01:54.733 --> 00:01:56.508 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o processamento é assíncrono,

49
00:01:56.518 --> 00:01:59.973 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e a Task informa o andamento.

50
00:02:03.746 --> 00:02:06.142 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Sem esse escopo, o sistema envia,

51
00:02:06.152 --> 00:02:08.210 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
mas não sabe o resultado.

52
00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.606 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Como o sistema obtém

53
00:02:09.616 --> 00:02:11.265 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
esses escopos? Primeiro,

54
00:02:11.275 --> 00:02:13.678 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
eles precisam estar liberados no cadastro.

55
00:02:13.688 --> 00:02:15.110 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No Simulador, você mesmo

56
00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.995 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
os informa ao registrar o sistema,

57
00:02:17.005 --> 00:02:19.240 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
como verá adiante no terminal.

58
00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:22.070 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Depois, a cada pedido de token, o sistema

59
00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.019 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
informa os escopos de que precisa,

60
00:02:24.029 --> 00:02:25.735 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o servidor concede apenas

61
00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.075 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
os que estão liberados no cadastro.

62
00:02:28.085 --> 00:02:29.401 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No ambiente oficial,

63
00:02:29.411 --> 00:02:31.584 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
eles são definidos no credenciamento,

64
00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:34.050 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
conforme o serviço da instituição.

65
00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.858 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Um escopo não liberado faz

66
00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.859 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o pedido de token ser recusado.

67
00:02:37.869 --> 00:02:40.304 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
E, se o token não tiver o escopo exigido,

68
00:02:40.314 --> 00:02:42.590 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a operação é recusada.

69
00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:45.983 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, um percurso pela interface.

70
00:02:45.993 --> 00:02:47.777 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com o Simulador em funcionamento,

71
00:02:47.787 --> 00:02:50.351 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
abra no navegador o endereço localhost,

72
00:02:50.361 --> 00:02:53.130 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
porta 8443.

73
00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.089 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No alto, o indicador mostra

74
00:02:55.099 --> 00:02:56.708 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que o Simulador está em execução,

75
00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:59.790 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
no ambiente de testes e de homologação.

76
00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.953 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O aviso no início da página confirma

77
00:03:01.963 --> 00:03:03.777 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o endereço e oferece o certificado

78
00:03:03.787 --> 00:03:06.690 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
do Simulador, que você baixa no terminal.

79
00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.610 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O menu leva a cada seção.

80
00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.454 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A seção Fluxo resume, em cinco passos,

81
00:03:12.464 --> 00:03:14.880 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o caminho até os recursos FHIR.

82
00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:16.444 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Gerar o certificado,

83
00:03:16.454 --> 00:03:19.571 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
registrar o cliente, gerar a assertion,

84
00:03:19.581 --> 00:03:23.793 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
obter o token com mTLS e acessar o FHIR.

85
00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:25.201 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Os dois primeiros passos

86
00:03:25.211 --> 00:03:26.890 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
formam o cadastro.

87
00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.464 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A seção Gerar Certificado do Cliente

88
00:03:29.474 --> 00:03:30.850 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
traz os comandos para criar

89
00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.600 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e conferir o certificado de teste,

90
00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.200 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
prontos para copiar.

91
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.313 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Em Gerenciamento de Clientes,

92
00:03:36.323 --> 00:03:38.821 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o registro informa o client_id,

93
00:03:38.831 --> 00:03:42.088 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o certificado X.509 e os escopos.

94
00:03:42.098 --> 00:03:44.671 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O Simulador vincula ao client_id

95
00:03:44.681 --> 00:03:47.310 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a impressão digital do certificado.

96
00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.463 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Repare que o exemplo da página usa

97
00:03:49.473 --> 00:03:52.348 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
valores próprios, como my-backend-app.

98
00:03:52.358 --> 00:03:54.245 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No curso, substitua-os por

99
00:03:54.255 --> 00:03:57.110 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
meu-sistema e pelos três escopos.

100
00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.321 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
As seções Autenticação e FHIR trazem

101
00:04:00.331 --> 00:04:02.226 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
os próximos módulos: o token,

102
00:04:02.236 --> 00:04:04.816 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
obtido por mTLS, e o envio,

103
00:04:04.826 --> 00:04:06.700 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
acompanhado pela Task.

104
00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.749 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, o mesmo cadastro no terminal,

105
00:04:09.759 --> 00:04:12.596 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
na pasta curso-hubsaude: o equivalente

106
00:04:12.606 --> 00:04:14.520 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
local do que o Ganesha faz.

107
00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.059 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Se quiser, pause o vídeo

108
00:04:16.069 --> 00:04:18.420 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e execute cada comando junto.

109
00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.187 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O primeiro comando gera o par

110
00:04:20.197 --> 00:04:22.152 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
de chaves e o certificado de teste,

111
00:04:22.162 --> 00:04:25.325 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
autoassinado, válido por 365 dias,

112
00:04:25.335 --> 00:04:27.640 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
para o titular meu-sistema.

113
00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.220 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Os pontos e sinais mostram o progresso.

114
00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:33.503 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Ao final, a pasta tem client-cert.pem,

115
00:04:33.513 --> 00:04:36.629 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a parte pública, e client-key.pem,

116
00:04:36.639 --> 00:04:38.240 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a chave privada.

117
00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.283 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O segundo comando confere o titular

118
00:04:40.293 --> 00:04:43.070 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o fim da validade, um ano depois.

119
00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.407 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O terceiro registra o sistema: o curl

120
00:04:46.417 --> 00:04:48.662 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
envia o client_id, o arquivo da parte

121
00:04:48.672 --> 00:04:51.519 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
pública e os três escopos. A opção -k

122
00:04:51.529 --> 00:04:54.360 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
aceita o certificado próprio do Simulador.

123
00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.513 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A resposta repete o cadastro: o client_id,

124
00:04:57.523 --> 00:04:59.368 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
os escopos liberados e o titular

125
00:04:59.378 --> 00:05:01.370 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
do certificado. No ambiente oficial,

126
00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.030 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o client_id vem do Ganesha.

127
00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.863 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Por fim, baixe o certificado do Simulador.

128
00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.603 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com ele, os seus programas confiam

129
00:05:08.613 --> 00:05:10.630 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
na conexão sem a opção -k.

130
00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.545 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O curl mostra o andamento

131
00:05:12.555 --> 00:05:14.336 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
da transferência, e a pasta passa a ter

132
00:05:14.346 --> 00:05:16.900 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
os três arquivos dos próximos módulos.

133
00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:19.721 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Atenção: o Simulador guarda os cadastros

134
00:05:19.731 --> 00:05:21.749 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
só na memória. Se ele for encerrado,

135
00:05:21.759 --> 00:05:24.570 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
inicie-o de novo e repita o cadastro.

136
00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.957 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Em resumo: no Simulador,

137
00:05:26.967 --> 00:05:28.455 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
você faz o papel do Ganesha,

138
00:05:28.465 --> 00:05:30.444 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com o certificado de teste e o client_id

139
00:05:30.454 --> 00:05:32.647 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
meu-sistema. Os escopos definem

140
00:05:32.657 --> 00:05:34.594 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o que o sistema pode fazer. E a chave

141
00:05:34.604 --> 00:05:37.200 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
privada nunca sai do seu computador.

142
00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.421 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No próximo vídeo, do módulo 3,

143
00:05:39.431 --> 00:05:41.568 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
você começa a montar registros FHIR,

144
00:05:41.578 --> 00:05:43.358 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
conhecendo as partes de um registro,

145
00:05:43.368 --> 00:05:45.650 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
do recurso ao Bundle.
